  <p class="mono eyebrow">Privacy</p>
  <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated 18 November 2026.</p>

  <h2>No cookies, no trackers</h2>
  <p>This website does not use cookies, analytics or any third-party trackers. It keeps two small notes in your own browser, and they are never sent anywhere:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>if you switch between the light and dark theme, your choice, until you clear it;</li>
    <li>that our robot, CREW, has already said hello, so he only introduces himself once. This one is deleted when you close the tab.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>When you email</h2>
  <p>The “What do you need?” boxes on this site only write an email in your own email app. Nothing is sent until you send it yourself.</p>
  <p>Emails you send to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> are held by our email provider, Zoho Mail, in its EU data centres. They are used only to reply to you and to do business with you. They are kept for as long as needed for that, and for as long as tax records must be kept.</p>

  <h2>Our automatic first reply</h2>
  <p>An automatic assistant reads new emails to {{ site.email }} and replies within minutes with a few first questions. It is not a person, and its reply says so. A person from CuSS follows up within one working day. Your email is used only to write that reply.</p>
  {{ ph('the service the assistant runs on, where it processes emails (EU or not), how long it keeps them, and whether the provider may use them to train its models') }}

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>This website is hosted on GitHub Pages, run by GitHub, Inc. Like any web host, GitHub records visitors’ IP addresses in its server logs to keep the service secure. We don’t receive or use those logs.</p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>The data controller is {{ site.legal.owner }}, sole trader, trading as {{ site.legalName }}, {{ site.legal.address }}, Ireland.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>To see the data held about you, or to ask for it to be corrected or deleted, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  <p>If you are not happy with how your data is handled, you can complain to the Data Protection Commission at <a href="https://www.dataprotection.ie" rel="noopener">dataprotection.ie</a>.</p>

